WEBVTT

00:12:29.495 --> 00:12:31.663
And that was the most amazing thing to me,

00:12:31.663 --> 00:12:34.666
like, people sending it in their Slack
channels to their bosses,

00:12:34.708 --> 00:12:36.418
texting it to their dads.

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:38.253
And I just think it's really insane,

00:12:38.295 --> 00:12:41.256
as we all know that half
the population bleeds

00:12:41.256 --> 00:12:45.344
and the other half has no idea
what is going on.

00:12:45.385 --> 00:12:47.805
And I'm really grateful for that.

00:12:47.846 --> 00:12:49.348
And I know it sounds cheesy,

00:12:49.389 --> 00:12:51.183
but I often just find myself thinking

00:12:51.183 --> 00:12:53.811
that I really hope
Sally would have liked it.

00:12:53.852 --> 00:12:55.354
So thank you all so much.

00:12:55.395 --> 00:12:56.563
Thank you.

00:12:56.605 --> 00:12:58.398
(Applause)